          <p style="color:#555555;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.7">Unlike asphalt shingles (which account for millions of tons of landfill waste annually), metal and tile roofing materials are fully recyclable. Your roof's lifecycle doesn't have to end in a dump.</p>
