            <p style="color:#555555;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7">The independent body that measures and publishes solar reflectance and thermal emittance for roofing products. Look for a CRRC-rated product label when comparing "cool roof" claims — it's the verifiable performance data behind the marketing.</p>
